{"articleNo":"433423","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=433423&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 도서관 환기 설비 개선 공사로 인한 자료실 이용안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.05.08","hit":"2352","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">도서관 환기설비 개선 공사로 인하여 자료실을 휴실하오니 도서관 이용에 참고하시기 바랍니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">자료실 휴실 안내</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">연속간행물실 휴실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 5.4(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) [1</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">일간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.4pt;\">제</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.4pt;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.4pt;\">․</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.4pt;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.4pt;\">자료실</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">휴실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 5.11(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)~5.12(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">), 5.18(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)~5.19(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)[4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">일간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 128, 185);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">도서대출 방법</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">도서관 홈페이지 로그인</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">도서검색</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">도서상세화면 클릭</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 4) (</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">온</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">버튼 클릭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">온라인 대출예약 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(*</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">개인정보 수집동의 체크</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 5)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">금오톡톡으로 대출승인 확인</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 6)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">도서관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">층 대출데스크에서 배부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">하루&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">[10-11</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, 15-17</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">시, 19-20시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">])</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span>대출데스크 오픈시간 변동 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span>찾아가지 않은 도서는 다음 근무일<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(15</span></span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, 22</span></span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></span>에 신청 취소됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">전자정보실 및 일반열람실은 정상운영 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">환기설비 공사 기간중 도서관 이용 중 소음 발생할 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"marker\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"></span><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family